; Copy this file to key.env and set a key there. key.env is git-ignored.
; Secret key for the /developer editor (used by api/upload.php and api/delete.php).
;
; 1. Replace the empty value below with a long random string, e.g. run:
;      php -r "echo bin2hex(random_bytes(32)), PHP_EOL;"
; 2. Paste the same key into /developer → Settings (the sliders icon).
;
; Publishing and image uploads stay switched off while this is empty.
; Never share this file or commit a real key to a public repository.

API_KEY=
